{"unit_id":"Kerberos255__dsh-web-search-router#card-zh","repo":"Kerberos255/dsh-web-search-router","commit":"ec7bcdc40d87c288b6cf217167fbe6eade0cbaa4","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-web-search-router 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的网页搜索路由插件，将 DSH 原生搜索提供方接到可配置的多服务优先级链。它按启用状态、配置情况和顺序调用 SearXNG、DeepSeek、Tavily、Brave、Exa、Firecrawl、Parallel 与 DuckDuckGo，并可在失败、超时、限流或空结果时继续尝试。用户还能调整提供方、超时、冷却及 SearXNG 地址。适合希望为 DSH 搜索配置多个来源并自动回退的使用者；外部提供方会收到搜索词，需自行配置服务地址或相应凭据。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:65-141","lib/router.js:118-205","lib/config.js:9-18"]}
{"unit_id":"Kerberos255__dsh-web-search-router#card-en","repo":"Kerberos255/dsh-web-search-router","commit":"ec7bcdc40d87c288b6cf217167fbe6eade0cbaa4","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-web-search-router routes DSH web searches through prioritized sources. It skips unconfigured providers and falls back after failures, timeouts, or empty results. A settings panel controls provider order, cooldowns, and timeouts. External services receive queries and may need credentials.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:65-141","lib/router.js:118-205","lib/config.js:9-18"]}
