{"unit_id":"Kerberos255__dsh-web-search-router#feature-1","repo":"Kerberos255/dsh-web-search-router","commit":"ec7bcdc40d87c288b6cf217167fbe6eade0cbaa4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-web-search-router 的功能「多提供方优先级路由」：按设置的顺序调用已启用且已配置的搜索服务，成功即返回结果；失败时继续尝试后续来源。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/router.js:129-163","lib/router.js:192-205"]}
{"unit_id":"Kerberos255__dsh-web-search-router#feature-2","repo":"Kerberos255/dsh-web-search-router","commit":"ec7bcdc40d87c288b6cf217167fbe6eade0cbaa4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-web-search-router 的功能「自动冷却与回退」：超时、网络异常、限流或额度错误可触发冷却并转向其他提供方；调用方主动取消则立即停止。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/router.js:80-94","lib/router.js:192-199"]}
{"unit_id":"Kerberos255__dsh-web-search-router#feature-3","repo":"Kerberos255/dsh-web-search-router","commit":"ec7bcdc40d87c288b6cf217167fbe6eade0cbaa4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-web-search-router 的功能「相对时间范围查询」：在查询末尾加 --day、--week、--month 或 --year 后，只路由到启用的 SearXNG，返回结果会标明筛选属于尽力匹配。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/router.js:14-35","lib/router.js:133-138","lib/router.js:185-190"]}
{"unit_id":"Kerberos255__dsh-web-search-router#feature-4","repo":"Kerberos255/dsh-web-search-router","commit":"ec7bcdc40d87c288b6cf217167fbe6eade0cbaa4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-web-search-router 的功能「设置面板」：在 DSH 插件设置中调整来源顺序、启停状态、SearXNG 地址、单源超时、冷却时间和空结果回退选项。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:269-280","lib/config.js:9-18"]}
{"unit_id":"Kerberos255__dsh-web-search-router#caveat-1","repo":"Kerberos255/dsh-web-search-router","commit":"ec7bcdc40d87c288b6cf217167fbe6eade0cbaa4","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-web-search-router 使用前须知：搜索词会发送到所选外部服务；相对时间筛选是尽力匹配，时效敏感时请核对原文日期。（见 lib/providers.js:63-186、lib/router.js:14-16）","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/providers.js:63-186","lib/router.js:14-16"]}
